    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36912" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαρθρ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dislocate the joints of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Ἀμαζόνες ἐ. τὸ ἄρσεν γένος τὸ
					ἑωυτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					53
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαρθρέεται τὰ
			τοιαῦτα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				58
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.876
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>to be dislocated,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαρθρήσαντα ὀστέα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					29
				</span></i>
			; <i>suffer from dislocations,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				53
			</span></i>.</div>
